    {
      "id": "p0147-b006",
      "kind": "aside",
      "source": {
        "text": "The secret stages in Super Mario World have very different names in Japanese and English - this sort of \"make it sound less bland\" approach is one of many different entertainment localization philosophies",
        "raw": "The secret stages in\nSuper Mario World\nhave very different\nnames in Japanese and\nEnglish - this sort of\n\"make it sound less bland\"\napproach is one of many\ndifferent entertainment\nlocalization philosophies",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.7223183,
          0.40964286,
          0.88665061,
          0.54153571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.72100089,
          0.40892857,
          0.88796802,
          0.54260714
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          19,
          20,
          21,
          22,
          23,
          24,
          25,
          26,
          27
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Super Mario World 的隐藏关卡，英日文名称差别很大。这种“让它听起来别那么平淡”的思路，也是娱乐作品本地化的诸多理念之一。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
