    {
      "id": "p0147-b025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Because these Super Mario World references would be lost in a literal translation, the translator replaced the English stage names with similar Japanese slang that sounds \"hip\" but is actually cheesy. Thus, the resulting translation prioritizes the scene's flow over the need to include any references.",
        "raw": "Because these Super Mario World references would be lost in a literal\ntranslation, the translator replaced the English stage names with similar\nJapanese slang that sounds \"hip\" but is actually cheesy. Thus, the resulting\ntranslation prioritizes the scene's flow over the need to include any references.",
